{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は午前中は\nTop Yellの取材を蘭世と受けてきました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、蘭世と距離感近くなってきた気がするけど\n蘭世と2人でお仕事って初めてかも＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午後は撮影があったんだけど\nひめたんと久々に会った感じがして\n「わ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃ～ん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」\nって言ってたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく考えたら今週は\n水曜日も会ってて月曜日も会ってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水曜日はあんまり喋ってなかったっちゃ喋ってなかったし\n月曜日ぶりみたいなもんかなーと思ったけど\nそれはそれで4日ぶりってそんなに久々じゃないよなーと思ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも毎日一緒のお仕事の日々だったから\nそんな感じがするのかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんと会えて良かった～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18日に\n『悲しみの忘れ方～Documentary of 乃木坂46～』のBlu-ray＆DVDが\n発売されました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本編には無かったけど\n中田もインタビューは受けてたんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちでは収録されてますので\n是非見てくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も乃木ぷぷ出ます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7週連続です、ありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はまさかのノーカットというね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノーカット怖いよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}